{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OAuth2ClientResponse\/profile"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"profile","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK20OAuth2ClientResponseV7profileAA0D7ProfileOvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"profile"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13ClientProfileO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ClientProfile"}],"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"profile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13ClientProfileO","text":"ClientProfile","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OAuth2ClientResponse"]]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/oauth2clientresponse\/profile"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"X5.1 — the registered posture and mTLS credentials. Read-back matters: an operator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"auditing which clients are financial-grade should be able to answer it from this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"endpoint rather than from the database."}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"kind":"sy